WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.345 --> 00:00:03.927
Start anywhere: press / to open universal search.

2
00:00:03.977 --> 00:00:07.193
Type a ticker or a name. Results are grouped by asset class.

3
00:00:07.243 --> 00:00:10.460
Enter opens the research page.

4
00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:14.426
Every module shows its data status and an exact time in IST.

5
00:00:14.476 --> 00:00:20.668
Change the period, and read any point with the crosshair.

6
00:00:20.718 --> 00:00:24.692
